1.3 Corrections from v0.3

This revision corrects the following:

1. Guaranteed domain sharpening.  \mathcal{S}_{\mathrm{guaranteed}}  is redefined to depend on both true state and estimate, eliminating ambiguity in P2.
2. Irreversibility index policy quantifier. D24 is restructured to quantify over admissible future policies.
3. Projected reference measure. A8 is restated as an assumption on the projected measure  \mu_{DFU} , not on the full perturbation measure  \mu .
4. Regularity of  A_\sigma . The  C^3  assumption is either derived or replaced by finite-difference statements.
5. Fallback non-absorbability. §13 formalizes the independent contraction induced by  \pi_{\mathrm{fb}} .

