17. Open Theoretical Problems

1. Derivation of the kernel-order condition. Whether P-ORD and P-KER can be weakened, or whether A6 can be replaced by more general stochastic-order relations, is open.
2. Characterization of A7 violations. Characterize systems in which irreversibility alters the instantaneous invariant.
3. Abstraction gap certificate. For a reduced-order abstraction  \hat{\mathcal{M}}  in which  \Delta_{DFU}  can be certified, what is the tightest bound relating  \Delta_{DFU}(\hat{\mathcal{M}})  to  \Delta_{DFU}(\mathcal{M}) ?
