5. Verifier–recoverability coupling. Does verifier latency enter  \mathcal{K}_{\mathrm{rec}}  only through  \mathcal{S}_{\mathrm{eff}} , or does the fallback policy  \pi_{\mathrm{fb}}  induce a distinct contraction that cannot be absorbed into the invariant? (P8 addresses the negative direction.)
