J.1.1 (Interval extension). For a function  f:\mathbb{R}^n\to\mathbb{R}  and an interval box  [\mathbf{a},\mathbf{b}] , the interval extension  F([\mathbf{a},\mathbf{b}])  satisfies

\{f(x):x\in[\mathbf{a},\mathbf{b}]\}\subseteq F([\mathbf{a},\mathbf{b}]).

